+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -2,6 +2,7 @@
 
 ## Unreleased
 
+- `Schedule.reschedule(appointment_id, new_start)` moves a live appointment to a new start time. The new time gets the same checks as `book()`, and a refused move leaves the appointment unchanged.
 - `Schedule.cancel(appointment_id)` marks an appointment cancelled instead of deleting it; cancelled appointments no longer block their slot.
 - Client register: `Client` dataclass and `ClientBook` with `add()` and `find_by_phone()`. Phone numbers are matched in any format (`079 …`, `+41 79 …`, `0041 79 …`).
 
